accTitle: Publishing an AMI value is not the instance rollout
accDescr: A tested AMI updates a stable Parameter Store key, then a stack change set resolves it into a launch-template version and an update policy replaces instances.
AMI["Image pipeline validates regional AMI"] --> P[("Parameter Store: approved AMI key")]
P -->|Resolve current value during stack operation| C["Create and inspect change set"]
C --> E["Execute stack update"]
E --> L["New launch-template version"]
L --> U["Configured Auto Scaling update policy"]
U --> I["Replace instances with approved AMI"]
N["Parameter change alone leaves existing hosts unchanged"] -.-> P
class AMI inputData
class P storage
class C decision
class I output
class N warning
